  "name": "tt",
  "description": "A self-hosting tree rewriting system and domain-specific language for subtree isomorphism and transformation. It implements a C-like tokenizer to generate document trees and provides a rule-based engine capable of Turing-complete computation through iterative pattern matching and replacement. The system includes a LISP-style evaluator and supports complex tree operations such as sequence splicing, set-based matching, and logical conjunction/disjunction within rules.",
